MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: Documents_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 76eedf465d0e3db4981b0591533a57cd, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 2300068806656
    m_Localized: TRAINING DOCUMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300131721216
    m_Localized: REDACTION PROCEDURE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915520
    m_Localized: Redact the name of the facility you will be assigned to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915521
    m_Localized: 'MEMORANDUM


      You will be assigned to the {{Information Control
      Department}}.

      _______________________


      Click a text fragment
      to [bold]redact[/] it with the [bold]marker[/].

      To redact several fragments
      in a row, hold down the left mouse button and drag across the text.


      Redact
      the name of the facility you will be assigned to, then submit the document
      for review by clicking the "SUBMIT DOCUMENT" button in the bottom-right corner.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915525
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Names of Organization facilities\n\u2022 Anomalous
      Fragments found in the text"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915522
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 000
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915523
    m_Localized: JOB INSTRUCTIONS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2300135915524
    m_Localized: "Welcome to the {{Information Control Department}}, Agent {PLAYER_NAME}.\n\nYour
      task will be to redact documents before they are processed by the {{Disinformation
      Center}}.\n\nSome information contains [bold]\"Anomalous Fragments\"[/] that
      can only be detected with special [bold]tools[/]. All of your tools are located
      on the right side of the screen.\n\nDue to the growing number of such fragments
      (including within the Organization's own documentation), every document must
      be [redact,uv]manually edited by Organization personnel[/].\n_______________________\n\nThis
      document contains an Anomalous Fragment \u2014 the [bold]\"Hidden Mark\"[/]
      \u2014 which can be detected using the [bold]ultraviolet lamp (UV LAMP)[/].\n\nHidden
      Marks [bold]differ in color[/] from the rest of the text.\n\nYou can also mark
      a text fragment with the [bold]pencil[/] if you are unsure about it but are
      not yet ready to [redact,uv]redact[/] it. Text marked with the pencil can still
      be detected by other tools and [bold]is not counted[/] when the document is
      submitted for processing.\n\nRedact only the information that matches the document
      assignment. The assignment is shown on the left side of the screen."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253372523921408
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 000.1
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253372599418880
    m_Localized: PERSONAL MESSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253372599418881
    m_Localized: 'Excellent work, {PLAYER_NAME}.


      After studying the Anomalous
      Fragment in your previous document, the Organization decided to use some similar
      fragments for its own purposes. The [redact]Research Department[/] named them
      [bold]"memetic agents," or "memagents"[/]. In this document, you must leave
      the following memetic agent unredacted:

      "((THERE IS NOTHING NEW UNDER
      THIS SUN))"

      _______________________


      From now on, [[read the
      assignments carefully]] for each individual document. [[Management]] will specify
      which memagents are intended for public release.


      [bold]IMPORTANT[/]:
      "Do not redact" instructions have [bold]priority over all other instructions[/].


      You
      may have already noticed that the [bold]CODEX[/] is now available to you. It
      contains the Organization''s terminology. Use it to clarify your current assignment.


      Starting
      with the next document, you will begin your [[full duties]].'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 253372599418883
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments\n\u2022 Mentions of Organization
      departments\n\nDo not redact:\n\n\u2022 The memagent specified in the document"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266054698319872
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 001
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266054761234432
    m_Localized: Lake Creature
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266054761234433
    m_Localized: 'On {{May 2}}, {{1933}}, in the Northern Scottish Highlands, the
      local newspaper Inverness Courier published a report about the {{Mackays}},
      a married couple who spotted a huge whale-like animal in the waters of [uv,redact]Loch
      Ness[/].


      After the story began gaining attention, [uv]Organization[/]
      agents were sent to the area. They were unable to establish contact with the
      couple, but other possible witnesses were questioned.


      According to
      the initial reports, the creature was about {{10}} meters long, had a neck
      [uv,redact]covered in fur or hair[/] that tapered toward the head, and a back
      [redact,uv]with several humps[/]. After conducting a reconnaissance operation,
      [uv]Organization[/] agents discovered the bodies of {{5}} local residents on
      the lakeshore, dressed in robes. Their bodies formed a [[star-shaped symbol]],
      with a trail leading from them into the water.


      After discovering the
      [redact,uv]bodies[/], the agents again attempted to contact the witnesses they
      had questioned, but the witnesses became extremely aggressive: they shouted
      [redact,uv]incomprehensible[/] phrases and attacked [uv]Organization[/] agents.
      All witnesses were [[eliminated]].


      The [uv]Organization[/] concluded
      that a cell of a [[currently unidentified cult]] exists in the region.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266054761234434
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Numbers\n\u2022 First and last names\n\u2022
      Anomalous Fragments\n\nDo not redact:\n\u2022 Mentions of the Organization"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266127087812608
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 003
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266127087812609
    m_Localized: BIG PEOPLE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266127087812610
    m_Localized: 'In [redact]2002[/], a graphic artist posted a photomontage of the
      "[uv,redact]excavation of a giant skeleton[/]" on [redact]Worth1000[/]. The
      image spread around the world as a sensation.


      The Organization''s AI
      agents began flagging the information as [magnifier,redact]potentially dangerous[/]
      and then attempted to contact the author. The author stated that he had previously
      worked for the [uv]Smithsonian Institution[/], which allegedly hides and destroys
      [magnifier,redact]real skeletons of giant humans[/] to avoid changing [uv,redact]history
      textbooks[/].


      Organization agents arrived at the [uv]National Museum
      of Natural History[/] in Washington to verify the information. They were met
      by the museum director, [redact]Rupert Lane[/], who gave [magnifier,redact]highly
      contradictory information[/] during questioning and denied the agents access
      to the museum archives.


      During the subsequent [uv,redact]investigation[/],
      the agents learned that [redact]Rupert Lane[/] did not appear in the museum''s
      official employee records. When they returned to the museum, the subject could
      not be found, and a [uv,redact]token[/] bearing a [magnifier,redact]five-pointed
      star[/] was discovered in his office.


      The Organization established
      that he is connected to the [magnifier,uv,redact]"Cult of the Starborn"[/].'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 266127087812611
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Text fragments containing numbers\n\u2022 First
      and last names\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments\n\nDo not redact:\n\u2022 Names
      of scientific institutions"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306465328381952
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306465340964864
    m_Localized: PERSONAL MESSAGE FROM MANAGEMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306465340964865
    m_Localized: 'T [[remendous work, Agent]]

      U [[nderstand that we appreciate
      the work you have done]]

      R [[est assured, you already understand how
      important your work is]]

      N [[ow Management is aware of your achievements
      and is promoting you]]

      B [decoder=WHY AREN''T YOU LOOKING AT ME?]UT
      THERE IS NOTHING NEW UNDER THIS SUN[/]

      A [[s a result, you are being
      transferred to a new facility]]

      C [[ommencing today]]

      K'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 306465340964866
    m_Localized: "\u2022 Follow orders\n\nRedact:\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057939662618625
    m_Localized: LINES IN THE SKY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057939662618626
    m_Localized: 'Chemtrails are a popular conspiracy theory. Supporters of the theory
      believe that the white trails left by aircraft in the sky are traces of [redact,magnifier]secret
      chemical spraying[/] intended to control the climate [redact,uv]or people[/].


      This
      information was spread by Organization agents after stories about chemtrails
      became popular among the public and politicians. According to information obtained
      from classified sources, [redact,magnifier]none of the aircraft[/] leaving
      such trails appear in any aviation database. The tail numbers of aircraft leaving
      chemtrails [uv,redact]could not be identified either[/], as they contain [redact,magnifier]cognitive
      hazards[/].


      On {{December 14}}, {{2000}}, Organization agents managed
      to track one such aircraft using an "EYE OF THE SUN"-class UAV. The aircraft
      was flying from Washington to Edinburgh and belonged to "[uv,magnifier,redact]Starborne
      Airlines[/]", with tail number N {{10202}}. No information about this airline
      could be found.


      This is the first case of [redact,magnifier,uv]cult[/]
      activity from Scotland recently recorded by the Organization.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057939662618627
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Numbers\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments\n\nDo not
      redact:\n\u2022 Mentions of the Organization"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057959837220864
    m_Localized: TRAINING DOCUMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057959837220865
    m_Localized: PERSONAL MESSAGE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057959841415168
    m_Localized: "You are performing well, Agent.\n\nDue to potential information
      leaks and possible activity by the Cult of the Starborn within the Organization,
      Management has decided to use a new memagent based on Anomalous Fragment: [bold]\"CIPHER\"[/].\n\nA
      new tool has been placed at your [redact]disposal[/] \u2014 the [bold]decoder[/],
      which will allow you to identify ciphers and uncover their true meaning.\n\nTo
      proceed, point the decoder at the following phrase:\n[decoder=disposal]ALL
      SECRETS WILL COME TO LIGHT[/]\n\nThen redact the word shown in the decoded
      message.\n\n[bold]IMPORTANT[/]: Anomalous Fragment \"CIPHER\" may be used against
      you by the Cult of the Starborn. Remember: your assignments have the highest
      priority."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057959841415169
    m_Localized: Follow the instructions in the document
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057859786293248
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 004
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057859891150848
    m_Localized: THEY SHOULDN'T BE THERE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057859891150849
    m_Localized: "In {{2015}}, a blogger using the name \"searchandrescuewoods\"
      on Reddit described incidents from his work in a park-ranger search-and-rescue
      service in the United States, as well as stories told by his colleagues.\n\nIn
      one of his posts, he wrote: \"Every time we were about {{30\u201335}} miles
      from the base, at some point we would find a staircase in the middle of the
      woods. It was as if someone had taken a staircase from an ordinary house, [redact,magnifier,uv]cut
      it out of there[/], and [redact,magnifier]placed it[/] in the woods. The first
      time I saw one, I had a lot of [redact,uv]questions[/], but I was told it was
      perfectly normal. Now I just [redact,uv]ignore[/] the stairs when I come across
      them: it happens [redact,magnifier]very often[/].\"\n\nThe post attracted the
      Organization's attention. [redact,decoder=YOU CAN'T HIDE]Undercover agents[/]
      were sent to national parks in the [magnifier]United States[/] for further
      investigation. According to the information they obtained, these stairs act
      as \"[redact,magnifier]portals[/]\" to other [redact,uv]dimensions[/]. In addition,
      [redact,decoder=Miles Marsh]one agent[/] stationed in [uv]Yosemite[/] reported
      that his colleagues claimed that even without climbing such a staircase, simply
      getting close enough to it would bring trouble.\n\nDuring one rescue operation,
      an agent managed to locate one of these staircases, consisting of {{5}} flights.
      While examining it, he discovered a [redact,uv,magnifier,decoder=Cult of the
      Starborn]star-shaped symbol[/] at its base and immediately reported it to the
      Organization. Further contact with the agent could not be established."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1057859891150850
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Text fragments containing numbers\n\u2022 First
      and last names\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments\n\nDo not redact:\n\u2022 Geographical
      names"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737424917544960
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 000.2
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425047568384
    m_Localized: TRAINING DOCUMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425051762688
    m_Localized: "You are doing well, {PLAYER_NAME}.\n\nFor your further work, a
      new tool has been issued to you \u2014 the [bold]\"Lens\"[/].\n\nThe Lens will
      allow you to locate a new type of Anomalous Fragment in the text \u2014 a [bold]\"Cognitive
      Hazard\"[/].\n\nPoint the Lens at the following text:\n\"[redact,magnifier]WE
      MOVE UNDER HIS GAZE[/]\"\n\nThis is how Cognitive Hazards will be detected.
      Keep in mind that a Cognitive Hazard may also be used as a memagent.\n\nTo
      continue, redact the Cognitive Hazard in this document and submit it for review."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425051762689
    m_Localized: Follow the instructions in the document
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425055956992
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 005
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425055956993
    m_Localized: LOST AND FOUND
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425055956994
    m_Localized: 'On {{April 30}}, {{2018}}, a series of posts appeared on Twitter
      from the [redact]account[/] [redact,decoder=Miles Marsh]"TheSunVanished"[/].
      The user said that he had woken up late in the morning, but the [magnifier,redact]sun[/]
      was nowhere to be seen. He shared photos and videos and described the events,
      panic, and dangers of a [uv,redact]world without the sun[/].


      After
      analyzing the series of posts, the Organization''s AI agents [magnifier,redact]raised
      the alarm[/] and reported a [decoder=account]"Convergence"[/]-class event.
      Organization agents attempted to contact the creator of the [redact]account[/],
      but all their attempts proved unsuccessful due to the large number of comments
      under the posts and the risk of exposing the Organization''s activities.


      Further
      analysis established that the user was not located in the [uv,redact]current
      reality[/], while his device was able to publish information into our''s due
      to an [magnifier,redact]unknown modification[/]. By order of Management, all
      interaction with the [redact]account[/] by the Organization was suspended.
      The investigation is ongoing.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1737425055956995
    m_Localized: "Redact:\n\n\u2022 Text fragments containing numbers\n\u2022 First
      and last names\n\u2022 Anomalous Fragments\n\nDo not redact:\n\u2022 Matching
      text fragments identified with the decoder"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1745272116396032
    m_Localized: DOCUMENT No. 002
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
